[
  {"note": "Chapter 1, the Shoals and the Meridian (C3), the other branches: Kade leads into the Shoals (the frozen lockbox only answers Nyx: the leader hint), Nyx leads and cracks it, the grotto chest (frost charm); in the wreck Orion leads and coaxes Kesi Danjuma's terminal, the ribbon wall (Nyx ties one), the sealed quarters door before the power; jumpTo('ch1.maw') -> Sera leads into the Maw, won at once -> the coil -> Driftmarket; the reactor hall afterwards: the coil gone, the chute shortcut to the Shoals Mouth"},
